12
01:19:30,000 --> 01:19:36,000
Truly, Madly, Deeply is a 1990 British fantasy drama film made for the BBC's
Screen Two series, by BBC Films, Lionheart and Winston Pictures.

13
01:26:07,500 --> 01:26:13,500
The film, written and directed by Anthony Minghella,
stars Juliet Stevenson and Alan Rickman.

14
01:32:45,000 --> 01:32:51,000
The film explores themes of london, england, river
thames, afterlife, cello, love.

15
01:39:22,500 --> 01:39:28,500
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
